# UI-4a in-game menu (launcher settings page over the frozen game), dolpic/0. Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0.
# menu tokens run one per 30 presented frames (launcher::menuDevQueue); the devscript itself waits while the menu is open.
# Evidence: [menu] open (chord) ... [menu] close (b) frames>=120 logic=N->N (no logic tick while open), dir.state=4 after,
# focus never none; F1 part: Mario position/status unchanged (W held inside the menu does not leak after close);
# control: W pushed with the menu closed moves Mario (pushed keys do reach the game).
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=60
log
# pad: R+Start chord opens, D-pad moves the focus, B closes; the shot is the first menu frame over the scene
menu chord,right,right,down,b
shot menu_chord.png
wait frames=30
log
# keyboard: F1 opens, W goes down inside the menu, F1 closes, W goes up 30 frames after the close
menu f1,key:W:down,f1,key:W:up
wait frames=60
log
# control: W held with the menu closed walks Mario
menu key:W:down
wait frames=45
menu key:W:up
wait frames=15
log
end
